-id=\"u9edced45\" id=\"u9edced45\">入队</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22xQueueSend%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22BaseType_t%20xQueueSend(%20QueueHandle_t%20xQueue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Ctconst%20void%20*%20const%20pvItemToQueue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20TickType_t%20xTicksToWait)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22xQueueSend%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xILlI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u250e3f05\" id=\"u250e3f05\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub37646dd\" id=\"ub37646dd\">参数说明：</span></p><ol list=\"ue2269727\"><li fid=\"u646b9dea\" data-lake-id=\"u010356cd\" id=\"u010356cd\"><code data-lake-id=\"uaf7c9f69\" id=\"uaf7c9f69\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa85ab81\" id=\"ufa85ab81\">QueueHandle_t xQueue</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7263871d\" id=\"u7263871d\">：队列句柄。</span></li><li fid=\"u646b9dea\" data-lake-id=\"u3b3f88d2\" id=\"u3b3f88d2\"><code data-lake-id=\"u8b6c4ecc\" id=\"u8b6c4ecc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11f2bcb5\" id=\"u11f2bcb5\">const void * const pvItemToQueue</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u75c7ca05\" id=\"u75c7ca05\">：数据。</span></li><li fid=\"u646b9dea\" data-lake-id=\"u0fb3ec7e\" id=\"u0fb3ec7e\"><code data-lake-id=\"u61c4c515\" id=\"u61c4c515\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd1d1f64\" id=\"ufd1d1f64\">TickType_t xTicksToWait</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0afbe0ec\" id=\"u0afbe0ec\">：入队列等待时间。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u65049e1f\" id=\"u65049e1f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua4c1cc02\" id=\"ua4c1cc02\">返回值:</span></p><p 